            {
              "id": "400c0b32-d5dd-4b2b-9127-099b6c8e572c",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": "<em><strong><strong>On the Play of the Child: Indications by Rudolf Steiner for Working with Young Children</strong></strong></em> is a compilation edited by Freya Jaffke, 2nd Revised edition published by Waldorf Early Childhood Association of North America, September 29, 2012."
            },
            {
              "id": "3c036578-4969-4657-9f4c-9acd0e3e65b9",
              "type": "paragraph",
              "html": ""
            },
            {
              "id": "2f784970-6976-49fd-8f13-e78a269ac879",
              "type": "quote",
              "html": "<em>A compilation of Rudolf Steiner's words on the subject of children's play, now in a second revised edition. This new edition of an essential resource for early childhood educators includes wisdom on the inner attitude of the teacher; imitation; the nature and meaning of children's play; toys and play materials; and creating the right environment for the child.</em>"
            }
          ]
